        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XVI} Cild binnan ðritegum nihta sie gefulwad; gif hit swa ne sie, xxx sciƚƚ gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A child must be baptized within thirty nights; if it is not, let him pay 30 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">A child shall be baptised within 30 days. If this is not done, [the guardian] shall pay 30 shillings compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Cyld binnan XXX nihtum sy gefullod; gif hit swa ne sy, xxx scll' gebete.</ab>
